BUGS FOUND:
============

1. CRITICAL - templates/level.html:74
   Stray {% endif %} with no matching {% if %}.
   Crashes ALL level detail pages with TemplateSyntaxError:
   "Encountered unknown tag 'endif'. Jinja was looking for... 'endblock'"

2. HIGH - templates/base.html:193-196
   "Submit Song" nav link points to url_for('profile.submit_record').
   Clicking "Submit Song" goes to /submit/record instead of a song page.
   Since submit_song route was deleted, this should be removed or relabeled.

3. CRITICAL - /admin/idbbl page (DB migration needed)
   SparkyImage model has level_id FK column, but the deployed DB
   doesn't have it yet. Crashes with:
   "sqlite3.OperationalError: no such column: sparky_image.level_id"
   Fix: ALTER TABLE sparky_image ADD COLUMN level_id INTEGER REFERENCES level(id);

4. LOW - newdesign.html (check for Submit Song refs too)

